Hi Kuk-Hyun,

You're right that it's at the line you indicated. There are going to be lots of problems with the model, but to address the issue you have with compiling, this is a scalar:

(Va1[p]*Lo_beta[1] + Va2[p]*Lo_beta[2] + Va3[p]*Lo_beta[3] + Va4[p]*Lo_beta[4] + Va5[p]*Lo_beta[5] + Va6[p]*Lo_beta[6])

I'm just taking wild guesses, but did you want to do something like:
Va1 * Lo_beta[1] + Va2 * Lo_beta[2] + ...

or

Va1[p] * Lo_beta + Va2[p] * Lo_beta + ...

You need to replace that expression with either a vector or a row_vector.

Daniel

P.S. Don't let Andrew see your interval priors.

