References: <-QwWiDbQp3U.Izq0J8J6AwAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com> <-QwWiDbQp3U.OcDFii2AAwAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-users/c/-QwWiDbQp3U/m/LqUTorGAAwAJ>
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
