Subject: Re: [stan-users] Improve efficiency for categorical factor analysis model?
Message-ID: <QDWOJNfPuLc.8CpDLjCXAwAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <QDWOJNfPuLc.S24FboM1BAAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
References: <QDWOJNfPuLc.G1Ua55pWAwAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com> <QDWOJNfPuLc.S24FboM1BAAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
