Subject: How to subset an array based on indices satisfying some condition?
Message-ID: <94BQm3MKIqw.7a4kjw-nAwAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-users/c/94BQm3MKIqw/m/7a4kjw-nAwAJ>
