> > >> You can use a one-hot encoding if you really must, but it's very
> > >> inefficient.
> > >>
> > >>>   }
> > >>> }
> > >>>
> > >>> model {
> > >>>   // Prior part of Bayesian inference (flat if unspecified)
> > >>>
> > >>>   // Likelihood part of Bayesian inference
