> >> Full code example:
> >>
> >> library(rstan)
> >> library(RWiener)
> >>
> >>
> >> set.seed(0)
> >> dat <- rwiener(n = 5000, alpha = 1, tau = 0.2, beta = 0.75, delta = 0.5)
