Subject: Warm-up slow, or halted?
Message-ID: <eS3p87YwAKI.Af9qXR8PBAAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <eS3p87YwAKI.DXDTR5XYAwAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
