From: u8aa9b8cc06fdc99c at groups.google.com (Bob Carpenter)
Date: Sat, 05 Mar 2016 20:01:05 +0000
Subject: Re: [stan-users] Warm-up slow, or halted?
Message-ID: <eS3p87YwAKI._gSIaAXFBAAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <eS3p87YwAKI.pCgHt1aIBAAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
References: <eS3p87YwAKI.DXDTR5XYAwAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com> <eS3p87YwAKI.pCgHt1aIBAAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
