Date: Sat, 05 Mar 2016 23:57:15 +0000
Subject: Re: [stan-users] Warm-up slow, or halted?
Message-ID: <eS3p87YwAKI.TAxxtejRBAAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <eS3p87YwAKI._gSIaAXFBAAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
