Local variables need to be defined before they're used,
so your problem is this line

  lp[k] <- lp[k] + ...

which is executed before lp[] gets a value.  You're probably
missing the mixing proportions:

  log_lik <- log(theta);

or if they're uniform, you want to just set, not increment.

- Bob

