Subject: Bayesian football model in rstan
Message-ID: <tAqis6Qq0l8.6XLoyi9kBQAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-users/c/tAqis6Qq0l8/m/6XLoyi9kBQAJ>
