Date: Thu, 17 Mar 2016 21:10:54 +0000
Subject: Re: [stan-users] Consequences of putting multiple models in model block
Message-ID: <9saYeOnNx48.Ok31jst3CAAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <9saYeOnNx48._W-_jAUtCAAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
