Subject: Re: [stan-users] Posterior uncertainty estimation for gaussian processes with non-gaussian observation models
Message-ID: <LzuGK6LaQks.fNFvCqyBCgAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <LzuGK6LaQks.WIXCymBKCgAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
References: <LzuGK6LaQks.wY4HJ_ZICgAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com> <LzuGK6LaQks.WIXCymBKCgAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
