Subject: Re: [stan-users] Multilevel Multivariate Probit Regression
Message-ID: <JDMqS13wi2s.G7j0sxKCCAAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <JDMqS13wi2s.pckCeN67BQAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
References: <JDMqS13wi2s.WRfS_JG8AQAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com> <JDMqS13wi2s.pckCeN67BQAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
